{"about_the_game":"Immerse yourself in a dystopian future with our cyberpunk card game. Hack, infiltrate, and outsmart your opponents as you battle in a neon-lit, high-tech world filled with intrigue and danger. Build the best Deck of augmented hackers, cybernetic mercenaries, and shadowy operatives to compete for dominance in this thrilling, cyber-enhanced card battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708200/extras/dea1375498e0136a1c415b1000f31816.avif?t=1702658004\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br><br><strong>Power Cards have 5 Types of cards colour coded.</strong> <br>Artifacts (Red), Spells (Green), Ability's (Purple), Boosters (Blue), Traps (Black).<br>Use these cards to get a advantage in game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708200/extras/4c24d00b574d4ba2816876b536330b50.avif?t=1702658004\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br><br><strong>Some Ability's to expect in game from Hero's/Legends.</strong><br><br>When placed, this card will clone itself '1' time.<br><br>When placed, this card will attack All cards on the board for '1' Hit Damage.(Self and Opponent)<br><br>Every time this card takes damage, its attack increases by '2'.<br><br>When this Legend card has been placed you Increase Player Health by '4'. Spawn a Random card from Deck start of Every turn.<br><br>When this Legend card has been placed you Increase Player Health by '10'.<br><br>When this Legend card has been placed you can Attack 2 Times and Increase Player Health by '5' and Give all Cards on the table +1 Turn to Attack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708200/extras/020e9522f1bd9dc0fa3799f86852e75c.avif?t=1702658004\" width=600 height=600 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag